///     |      |  closed  |          | send R /  |  closed  |      |
///     |      | (remote) |          | recv R    | (local)  |      |
///     |      +----------+          |           +----------+      |
///     |           |                |                 |           |
///     |           | send ES /      |       recv ES / |           |
///     |           | send R /       v        send R / |           |
///     |           | recv R     +--------+   recv R   |           |
///     | send R /  `----------->|        |<-----------'  send R / |
